<title>BRAZIL: Brazil weekly soybean and product shipment.</title>
<headline>Brazil weekly soybean and product shipment.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>SGS do Brasil reported the following Brazilian soybean and products shipments in the week ended November 17 compared with the previous week and the corresponding week last year, in tonnes -</p>
<p>    Week ended   Week ended   Week ended</p>
<p>	     17/11/96     10/11/96     19/11/95</p>
<p> Bean	  4,100	  1,900	  nil</p>
<p> Meal	164,800	277,600	247,700</p>
<p> Oil	  59,200	 41,400	 55,200</p>
